//job-boards.greenhouse.io/celonis/jobs/8046316003?gh_jid=8046316003", "source": "Greenhouse Direct ATS", "timestamp": 1795178252, "date_posted": "Nov 20, 2026", "raw_department": "Corporate", "salary_raw": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model \u2014 which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI's operational blind spots into operational clarity. World's leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there's a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.</p></div><p><strong>The Team:</strong></p>\n<p>The GTM Strategy &amp; Execution team plays a crucial role in driving the rocketship growth of Celonis. As Business Partners to the Sales leadership, we prepare &amp; drive decision making, foster execution and help steer the business. Across the team, you will find a mix of projects in strategic planning, sales operations, finance, and business analytics \u2013 requiring a mix of strategy, go-to-market design, market analysis, sales optimization, and business operational support.</p>\n<p>You will report directly to the VP EMEA APAC Revenue Strategy &amp; Operations and be based out of our multicultural and vibrant office in Munich.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The Role:<br></strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></span>As an Intern in Strategy &amp; Operations you will play a key part in supporting EMEA leadership to drive and execute on the continued success of Celonis by supporting our business growth strategy. Sample projects range from highly strategic to operational including evaluating market opportunities, business planning, process optimization and regular review of key performance metrics. The role requires interaction with various areas of the organization and provides exposure to senior executives. You will be working closely with stakeholders from other Celonis departments like Value Engineering, Marketing, Process &amp; Tools, Analytics, Finance, etc.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The work you\u2019ll do:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support the annual EMEA planning process, including organizational design, territory carving, comp plan design and target setting</li>\n<li>Define GTM strategy- including sales territory design, analysis and presentation of Market Opportunity to drive Celonis penetration into different regional markets</li>\n<li>Leverage internal and external data to provide actionable commercial insights that can deliver revenue growth</li>\n<li>Drive strategic projects into the execution phase and partner with teams across the organization to deliver on implementation</li>\n<li>Identify key opportunities for business improvement through analytics &amp; quantitative insights&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Run Regional and EMEA Wide forecasting, sales performance and dem generation governance</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The qualifications you need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Currently enrolled in a Bachelor's or Master's degree program in Business, Economics, or a related field (or holding a completed Bachelor's degree)</li>\n<li>First Experience in Sales Operations, SaaS business, Consulting or Investment Banking</li>\n<li>Experience in MS Excel and PPT or G-suite tools</li>\n<li>Strong analytical mindset and communication skills</li>\n<li>Proficient in spoken and written English (Additional language is a plus, but not a must)</li>\n<li>Results-driven, detail-oriented, self-motivated with the ability to work independently</li>\n<li>Experience in Salesforce is a plus</li>\n<li>Based in Munich and able to work one-site from the Celonis Munich Office.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>What Celonis can offer you:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\" data", "category": "BizOps & Strategy", "match_score": 97, "tier": "Tier 1 (High Conversion)", "location_info": {"region": "Germany", "score": 0.98, "visa_note": "Opportunity Card & Student visas, English tech startups, welcoming climate", "badge": "\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea Germany"}, "visa_info": {"is_sponsored": true, "tier": "Verified Visa Assistance", "badge": "\ud83d\udec2 Visa Sponsored", "note": "Actively sponsors and assists with intern work visas and relocation across German & Spanish hubs.", "boost": 4}, "pay_info": {"pay_display": "Not mentioned", "pay_monthly_usd": 0, "pay_monthly_inr": 0, "is_disclosed": false, "is_unpaid": false, "note": "Compensation is not publicly disclosed in the posting."}, "recruiter_pitch": "Hi! I noticed the Strategy & Operations Intern opening at Celonis. I currently run operations & full P&L for a 10,000+ student education brand (AnybodyCanBake) with 5-7 team members alongside my degree at IIM Bangalore. Would love to bring proven execution and problem-solving to Celonis.", "is_new": true}, {"id": "9b610098d5e36e1bf62223321eed3ff8", "company": "Gallagher", "title": "Marketing Intern", "location": "Canton, GA, United States", "url": "https://jobright.ai/jobs/info/6ac6cb328ff3fb9b3bc8f3b8?utm_campaign=1065&utm_source=git", "source": "Jobright Growth & Marketing", "timestamp": 1795132800, "date_posted": "Nov 20", "raw_department": "Growth & Marketing", "salary_raw": "| **[Gallagher](https://www.gallagher.com/)** | **[Marketing Intern](https://jobright.ai/jobs/info/6ac6cb328ff3fb9b3bc8f3b8?utm_campaign=1065&utm_source=git)** | Canton, GA, United States | Hybrid | Nov 20 |", "category": "Growth & Marketing", "match_score": 65, "tier": "Tier 3 (Stretch)", "location_info": {"region":